# Wiki

This directory is a KOMPEND wiki project. Sources are read from
`{{ sources_dir }}/`, the compiled wiki is written to `{{ output_dir }}/`, and
runtime state lives in `.kompend/`.

## Quickstart

1. Drop source documents into `{{ sources_dir }}/`.
2. Run `kompend compile` to build the wiki.
3. Inspect the output in `{{ output_dir }}/`.

## Configuration

Project configuration lives in `.kompend/config.toml`. See
[the configuration guide](https://kompend.readthedocs.io/guides/config.html)
for the full reference, or browse the comments in the config file
itself.

To inspect or modify configuration values from the CLI:

    kompend config list
    kompend config get compile.chunk_size
    kompend config set compile.chunk_size 1024

## Layout

| Path           | Purpose                                          |
| -------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| `{{ sources_dir }}/` | Input documents (PDF, DOCX, MD, …)               |
| `{{ output_dir }}/`  | Compiled output (Markdown + Obsidian frontmatter)|
| `.kompend/`       | Internal state (cache, config) — gitignored      |
| `.kompend/config.toml` | Project configuration (created by `kompend init`) |
| `NOTES.md`     | User-authored notes (read-only to KOMPEND)          |

